WEBVTT

00:00:00.317 --> 00:00:01.893
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Vague language

00:00:02.397 --> 00:00:03.056
1

00:00:03.764 --> 00:00:06.277
Avoiding unnecessary detail

00:00:07.162 --> 00:00:07.884
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:10.915
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you getting the train back to uni?

00:00:11.181 --> 00:00:14.150
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, luckily my parents said they’d drive me.

00:00:14.376 --> 00:00:18.806
I’ve got loads of stuff and it’ll be much easier to just put it all in the car.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.281
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:22.277 --> 00:00:23.969
<v><b>A:</b></v> What’s wrong with your pen?

00:00:24.262 --> 00:00:27.307
<v><b>B:</b></v> The top bit’s dropped off and I can’t get it to work.

00:00:29.305 --> 00:00:30.113
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.475
<v><b>A:</b></v> What do you think of the hotel?

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.146
<v><b>B:</b></v> Well, there’s one thing I’m not very keen on.

00:00:35.396 --> 00:00:36.282
<v><b>A:</b></v> What’s that?

00:00:36.577 --> 00:00:41.804
<v><b>B:</b></v> Well, the bar’s nice, but it’s really noisy, and you can hear the music from our room.